00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Mesa, Arizona

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.000
One Landsat pass: July 29, 2025

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Surface heat, not air temperature.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.500
Encanto: 137.3 °F. Little visible tree cover.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.500
To Alta Mesa: 1.48 miles straight-line.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.500
Alta Mesa: 120.4 °F. More tree cover.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:34.500
To Red Mountain: 2.56 miles straight-line.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:40.500
Red Mountain: 124.7 °F, between the two.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:45.500
Here, trees shade only part of the pavement.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.500
Three new trees block direct sun.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.500
More canopy can extend cooler pavement.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:58.500
18 trees shown. Cooling was not measured.
